docs/ideation/2026-04-17-open-ideation.md:11:Cairn is a Claude Code plugin implementing Karpathy's LLM Wiki pattern — a persistent markdown knowledge vault maintained by the agent across sessions.
docs/ideation/2026-04-17-open-ideation.md:13:**Shape.** TypeScript CLI on Bun (~900 LOC total across `src/`). Three hooks: `inject` (SessionStart, budgeted context injection), `session-summary` (Stop, structured summary writer), and a PostCompact re-injector. Three skills: `cairn` (ingest/query/lint), `extract` (sessions → wiki), `refine` (structural vault improvements). `templates/CAIRN.md` is the vault schema. Optional `qmd` MCP for hybrid search. Optional Entire integration for richer session capture.
